1
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,280
You.

2
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:53,060
You said you didn't care about this wedding.

3
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:53,580
Look.

4
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:55,720
Every one of them is a big shot.

5
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:57,160
All right.

6
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:58,920
If he can settle down,

7
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:00,960
it will take a load off my mind.

8
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:01,700
Go.

9
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,860
Send out the invitations according to the list.

10
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:15,020
Mr. Ling.

11
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:19,230
What happened? Why are you in such a panic?

12
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,440
Good.

13
00:01:37,039 --> 00:01:37,900
Yes, come on.

14
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:39,039
One more.

15
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:41,400
Okay, let's change the pose.

16
00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:47,039
Very good, come on.

17
00:01:48,860 --> 00:01:49,660
Yes.

18
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:52,140
Come on, smile.

19
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:55,240
Good, very good.

20
00:01:55,940 --> 00:01:56,860
One more.

21
00:01:58,740 --> 00:01:59,380
Good.

22
00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:07,800
Okay, I'll be right back.

23
00:02:10,060 --> 00:02:10,900
What's wrong?

24
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:11,880
Nothing.

25
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:13,900
But my father has an emergency and asked me to go back.

26
00:02:13,900 --> 00:02:15,300
I have to go back right now.

27
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:16,500
Do you need me to go with you?

28
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:16,960
No need.

29
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:18,800
I'll be right back after I handle it.

30
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:19,500
Okay.

31
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:22,140
Do you know

32
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,340
the true identity of your fiancée?

33
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,700
I don't understand what you mean.

34
00:02:32,660 --> 00:02:34,720
She is the daughter of that reporter.

35
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:40,300
This...

36
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:41,900
How is that possible?

37
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:44,360
I didn't expect you to be so stupid.

38
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:46,440
Shut up.

39
00:02:47,540 --> 00:02:49,200
You don't deserve to be my son.

40
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:50,800
Right now,

41
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:54,000
go and get rid of her immediately.

42
00:02:54,620 --> 00:02:55,140
Okay.

43
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:56,560
You go with him.

44
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,220
Dad, I can do it myself.

45
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:06,060
Make it clean.

46
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:15,500
Mr. Ling,

47
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,680
the surveillance video from the KTV that day

48
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,410
shows something very strange.

49
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,600
The surveillance must have malfunctioned.

50
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:39,260
I suspected that at first too,

51
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:41,360
but judging from the time of the surveillance,

52
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,890
the video itself is intact.

53
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:57,360
Find him immediately.

54
00:03:58,540 --> 00:03:59,340
Yes.

55
00:04:37,159 --> 00:04:38,940
What are you doing?

56
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:46,300
Who is it?

57
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:53,960
Who are you?

58
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,200
Who are you? Let me go!

59
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,930
You didn't answer my calls.

60
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,340
I'm so tired today.

61
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,640
I've been trying on clothes all day.

62
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:10,560
Honey,

63
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:13,160
what kind of wedding does your father like?

64
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:15,000
Grand or more private?

65
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,420
Either is fine.

66
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,680
As long as you like it.

67
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,800
Then I'll do it Chinese style.

68
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:24,520
I'll go book the hotel tomorrow.

69
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:25,100
Okay.

70
00:05:26,020 --> 00:05:26,600
Here.

71
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,640
I have something for you.

72
00:05:41,159 --> 00:05:42,820
Another glass. Add extra ice.

73
00:05:43,340 --> 00:05:44,140
Okay, sir.

74
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:03,240
I have something for you.

75
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,360
What is it?

76
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,440
Consider it

77
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,600
a wedding gift.

78
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:27,840
What is this?

79
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,690
Your father's belongings.

80
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:40,560
I was so sincere to you.

81
00:06:43,980 --> 00:06:45,060
Why have you

82
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:47,960
been lying to me?

83
00:06:51,140 --> 00:06:51,940
I'm just a tool you use

84
00:06:51,940 --> 00:06:53,400
to please your father.

85
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:54,570
What did you say?

86
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,200
Let me go.

87
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:04,960
Let go.

88
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:14,760
I can give you whatever you want.

89
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,300
Why did you have to lie to me?

90
00:07:16,300 --> 00:07:19,230
You bastard. I'll send you to prison sooner or later.

91
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:34,620
You killed my only family.

92
00:07:34,740 --> 00:07:36,200
I'll kill you.

93
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:41,540
Yao.

94
00:07:41,540 --> 00:07:42,470
Chen Yao, right?

95
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,460
I'll send you to see him right now.

96
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:07,690
Chen Yao.

97
00:08:08,020 --> 00:08:09,860
Chen Yao, you can't kill anyone. Chen Yao!

98
00:08:09,860 --> 00:08:10,390
Chen Yao.

99
00:08:11,940 --> 00:08:13,460
Let go, Chenyao.

100
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:14,900
Let go.

101
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:16,830
You said you wouldn't hurt anyone.

102
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:41,460
W-We're back again.

103
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:49,060
I thought we wouldn't make it back this time.

104
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:51,500
How did you know Lingze would hurt me?

105
00:08:52,700 --> 00:08:53,630
Mucheng told me.

106
00:09:04,140 --> 00:09:05,000
It's him.

107
00:09:08,740 --> 00:09:10,470
He's the one who stole my phone.

108
00:09:13,300 --> 00:09:14,360
It's dangerous now.

109
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,200
Come with me.

110
00:09:17,340 --> 00:09:20,200
Mucheng wanted to repay me for saving her last time,

111
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:24,760
so she told me everything that happened before.

112
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,840
I really didn't expect this.

113
00:09:28,140 --> 00:09:29,440
How could it be her?

114
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:35,140
Lingze is too dangerous.

115
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:37,960
We finally got a chance to start over.

116
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:39,820
We must be careful in every way this time.

117
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:40,360
Okay.

118
00:09:45,940 --> 00:09:47,000
What's wrong?

119
00:09:48,700 --> 00:09:49,380
What's wrong with you?
